# corp-london — primary office gateway
client
dev tun
proto udp
remote vpn-london.example.net 1194 udp
remote vpn-london2.example.net 1194 udp
resolv-retry infinite
nobind
persist-key
persist-tun
remote-cert-tls server
cipher AES-256-GCM
data-ciphers AES-256-GCM:AES-128-GCM
tls-version-min 1.2
verb 3

<ca>
-----BEGIN CERTIFICATE-----
ca-block-not-parsed-for-expiry
-----END CERTIFICATE-----
</ca>
